{"unit_id":"dream-num__dsh-univer-office#card-zh","repo":"dream-num/dsh-univer-office","commit":"b7dea7cb03e4bfeeba2b1a6723e30eaa6b264ba2","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH × Univer Office 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的办公内容插件。它通过 host 工具和 browser client 接入 Univer，为 `.univer` 文件提供创建、Office 文件导入导出、结构化检查与编辑、工作树审阅，以及对话中的实时预览和修改卡片。适合希望让 agent 处理电子表格、文档、演示文稿、数据库表和画布，并在发布前查看草稿变化的用户。需要 DSH Web 与 Node.js，浏览器渲染还需浏览器环境；无需额外 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/index.ts:36-47","src/host/tools/plugin.ts:30-47","src/client/index.tsx:40-56","src/client/components/preview-card.tsx:46-88"]}
